        "abstract": "Xerox Corporation has spent the last year and one half in the study and development of systems to solve the ever-increasing problem of efficient radio dispatching for Law Enforcement, Utilities, Fire, Ambulance, Commercial services industries and any other activities that require radio dispatching. Some of the unique features that Xerox Corporation is using to solve these problems are software and hardware modularity concepts, multi-shared system concepts, and foreground/background operation. The areas that this paper addresses are the current problems, the concerns and Xerox's solutions to these problems using computerized system concepts that are state-of-the-art and currently being put to use throughout the United States today.",
