        "abstract": "The design of Electronic Fuel Injection (EFI) controls for the automobile must take into account limitations imposed by the automotive environment and by mass production. This paper outlines the fundamentals of EFI controls and provides insight into the unique problems encountered in the design of a viable system. The impact of the electrical and physical automotive environment is analyzed, and the constraints arising from volume production and cost considerations are discussed.",
